<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM Int. completes share offering in Amsterdam.</title>
<headline>ASM Int. completes share offering in Amsterdam.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASM International said on Thursday it had succesfully completed its offering on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange of 4,100,000 shares at a price of 18 guilders per share.</p>
<p>The shares were listed on the Amsterdam stock exchange from today.</p>
<p>The securities offered have not been and will not be registered under the US Securities Act of 1933 and may not be offered or sold in the United States without registration or an exemption from registration.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
